### Inference vs Training in Systolic Arrays

| Aspect | Inference | Training |
|--------|-----------|----------|
| Dominant op | 1 matmul/layer (forward) | 3 matmuls/layer (1 forward + 2 backward) |
| MACs | N³ (= 2·N³ FLOPs) | 3·N³ MACs (= 6·N³ FLOPs) per layer |
| Dataflow | **Weight-stationary** preferred (minimizes weight BW) | No single dominant dataflow (output- or row-stationary, e.g., Eyeriss) |
| Memory | Just forward activations | Also stores X for dW = X^T·dY |
| Hardware | TPU/Trainium: weight-stationary forward, different backward tiling | More flexible compute fabric needed |

