## Key Formulas

| Formula | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| I = G · V | Analog MVM via Ohm's + Kirchhoff's laws in crossbar |
| Q_j = Σᵢ C(i,j) · V(i) | Charge-domain MVM (capacitive crossbar) |
| a_i[t] = Σⱼ w_ij · s_j[t-1] | LIF synaptic input (Loihi) |
| u_i[t] = λ_u · u_i[t-1] + a_i[t] | LIF current state |
| v_i[t] = λ_v · v_i[t-1] + u_i[t] | LIF voltage state, spike when v > threshold |
| C_m·V̇ = -g_l(V-E_l) + g_l·Δ_T·exp((V-V_T)/Δ_T) - w + I | AdEx neuron (BrainScaleS-2) |
| τ_w·ẇ = a(V-E_L) - w | AdEx adaptation variable |
| DRAM = 2 nJ, INT4 mul = 0.1 pJ | ~20,000× energy gap motivating IMC |
| Sparse crossover ≈ 70% | Below this, dense crossbar beats sparse formats |

